{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105701","id":2478136297,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6TtVvp","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105701","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105701.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105701.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105701","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105701/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105701/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105701/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/63f6e3691cc1058dd89188e0a02178a53e5b7a94","number":105701,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Implement DrawableTextures","user":{"login":"ColinSORourke","id":44822820,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODIyODIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44822820?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinSORourke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7379\r\n\r\n[EDITED 9/25 to match completed state of PR]\r\n\r\nThis PR is an implementation of @reduz's proposal for Drawable Textures in the Godot Engine. Authored primarily by me, with some much appreciated assistance from @clayjohn  and @BastiaanOlij.\r\n\r\nSee Demo Vid:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/95b1f1dc-fa03-4788-b03c-ffad469ede48\r\n\r\nDownload Demo Project: [drawable-texture-tests.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22552003/drawable-texture-tests.zip)\r\n\r\nThe implementation follows Reduz’s specification pretty strictly, with a few departures based on feedback from Rendering Contributor Meetings. Most importantly, we decided to leave implementation of Blit_Polygon functions for a future pull request due to complexity.  We also added a p_material parameter to Blit_Rect & Blit_Rect_Multi on the user exposed resource to allow users to pass their own materials into the resource (if left blank, still defaults to 'default material').\r\n\r\nThis PR implements:\r\nThe Rendering Server API for DrawableTextures \r\n```cpp\r\nenum TextureDrawableFormat {\r\n   TEXTURE_DRAWABLE_FORMAT_RGBA8,\r\n   TEXTURE_DRAWABLE_FORMAT_RGBA8_SRGB, // Use this if you want to read the result from both 2D (non-hdr) and 3D.\r\n   TEXTURE_DRAWABLE_FORMAT_RGBAH,\r\n   TEXTURE_DRAWABLE_FORMAT_RGBAF,\r\n};\r\n\r\n// Create\r\nRID texture_drawable_create(int p_width, int p_height, TextureDrawableFormat p_format, const Color &p_color = Color(1, 1, 1, 1), bool p_with_mipmaps = false);\r\n\r\n// Blit a rect\r\nvoid texture_drawable_blit_rect(const TypedArray<RID> &p_textures, const Rect2i &p_rect, RID p_material, const Color &p_modulate, const TypedArray<RID> &p_source_textures, int p_to_mipmap = 0);\r\n\r\n// Utility functions\r\nRID texture_drawable_get_default_material(); // To use with simplified functions in DrawableTexture2D\r\nvoid texture_drawable_generate_mipmaps(RID p_texture) // Populate the mipmaps for this drawable texture\r\n``` \r\nThe new ShaderType, TextureBlit Shaders\r\n```glsl\r\nshader_type texture_blit\r\n// Optional render modes:\r\nrender_mode blend_mix /* default , also available: blend_add, blend_sub, blend_mul */;\r\n\r\nuniform sampler2D source_texture : hint_blit_source0;\r\nuniform sampler2D source_texture1 : hint_blit_source1;\r\n// up to 4 sources\r\n\r\nvoid blit() {\r\n     // Read sources and blit\r\n     COLOR0 = texture(source_texture,UV) * MODULATE;\r\n     COLOR1 = texture(source_texture1,UV);\r\n     // up to COLOR3\r\n}\r\n```\r\nAnd several user-exposed Resource classes to interact with DrawableTextures, most importantly of course, DrawableTexture2D\r\n```cpp\r\nclass DrawableTexture2D : public Texture2D {\r\n   enum DrawableFormat {\r\n       DRAWABLE_FORMAT_RGBA8,\r\n       DRAWABLE_FORMAT_RGBA8_SRGB,\r\n       DRAWABLE_FORMAT_RGBAH,\r\n       DRAWABLE_FORMAT_RGBAF,\r\n   };\r\n    void setup(int p_width, int p_height, DrawableFormat p_format, const Color &p_modulate = Color(1, 1, 1, 1), bool p_use_mipmaps = false);\r\n    void blit_rect(const Rect2i p_rect, const Ref<Texture2D> &p_source, const Color &p_modulate = Color(1, 1, 1, 1), int p_mipmap = 0, const Ref<Material> &p_material = Ref<Material>());\r\n    void blit_rect_multi(const Rect2i p_rect, const TypedArray<Texture2D> &p_sources, const TypedArray<DrawableTexture2D> &p_extra_targets, const Color &p_modulate = Color(1, 1, 1, 1), int p_mipmap = 0, const Ref<Material> &p_material = Ref<Material>());\r\n\r\n   void generate_mipmaps();\r\n};\r\n```\r\n\r\nI made a detailed listing of the  modified files in a spreadsheet [here](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1SR8Irf4NM7dqYEHa2qnSMqH9q2wZIY-_SLiEfz8grFA/edit?usp=sharing)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n*Bugsquad edit:* Implements and fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7379","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z","due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-04-24T06:34:54Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T10:06:58Z","closed_at":"2026-01-30T15:49:00Z","merged_at":"2026-01-30T15:49:00Z","merge_commit_sha":"fd6e80d4e97ccd4ab4146db018df91c20e07ab4e","ass